  "description": "1000W Brushless Motor\n\nThe Lankeleisi RV700 features a 48V 1000W rear brushless motor, enabling smooth acceleration up to 25 km/h for versatile all-terrain riding. Using the rear derailleur allows for more comfortable speed control, even when in pedal-assist mode.\n\n48V 20Ah SAMSUNG Lithium Battery\n\nThe Lankeleisi RV700 is powered by a removable 48V 16Ah high-capacity battery made with 18650 cells, designed for long-distance rides. It provides up to 120 km of range in pedal-assist mode and 55 km in full electric mode. With an IP54 waterproof rating, it can handle splashes and wet conditions with ease.\n\nFront Fork Suspension & Rear Suspension\n\nThe Lankeleisi RV700 features a full-suspension system with a durable, long-travel aluminum front fork and rear shock absorber. It smooths out road bumps and minimizes rider fatigue, providing a comfortable and enjoyable off-road riding experience.\n\nLCD Color Display\n\nColour Backlight Display to keep track of speed, mileage, power and more.",
